# Source photographs, not site assets.
#
# public/photos/originals/ holds the full-resolution originals the served
# .webp files were produced from. Nothing links them, but Workers uploads
# everything under the assets directory, so they were being deployed and
# were publicly fetchable at dentologia.ro/photos/originals/*.jpg — 2.2MB
# of the largest files in the deploy, enumerable by anyone.
photos/originals
